# Task Evidence: P3-T6 Boarding QR Code Display & Manual Check-in

## 1. Commit SHA
`6de3ed6`

## 2. Changed Files
- `packages/contracts/src/driver.dto.ts` (Manual check-in reason enum, request and response DTO schemas)
- `services/api/src/modules/driver/driver.controller.ts` (POST `/api/v1/driver/checkin`, GET `/api/v1/driver/manifest/:tripId`)
- `services/api/src/modules/driver/driver.service.ts` (Manual check-in handler with guest/reason rules and manifest updates)
- `scripts/verify-routes-auth.ts` (Registered driver checkin and manifest routes)
- `apps/mobile/src/driver/driver-qr-generator.ts` (30s rotating HMAC-SHA256 QR generator with circular countdown state)
- `apps/mobile/src/driver/driver-checkin-manager.ts` (Passenger manifest manager, offline check-in buffer, sequential sync)
- `apps/mobile/src/driver/index.ts` (Exported QR generator and check-in manager)
- `apps/mobile/test/driver-boarding.spec.ts` (12 unit tests validating rotating QR, countdown, manual check-in, guest flagging, offline queue)

